	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100%" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="center" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Fascinate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Mesmerizes the target. (Any hostile action or damage will awaken the target) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Ego Shock </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Mental damage and prevents any movement on the target opponent. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Signet of Intuition </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Intelligence and Agility, and grants Mental mitigation to the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Veil of the Unseen </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Invisibility and movement speed recution. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13.2 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Daunting Gaze </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Drains Power instantly and stuns the target opponent. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">14 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Gloom </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does Mental damage over-time to the target, and decreases Arcane (Magic, Mental, &amp; Divine) mitigations for the duration. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer/Enchanter/Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lightning Surge </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Does instant Magic damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Cerebral Spasm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals mental damage over time and drains power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Blink </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">A short distance teleport. Also reduces aggro. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">16.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Overwhelming Silence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Drains Power over-time and prevents the target opponent from casting spells or using abilities. (This excludes certain special abilities) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Mind Jolt </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals mental damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Stupefy </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Stuns the target for a brief period of time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">18.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Breeze </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes the target group member&#39;s Power over-time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Enchanter </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Binding Light </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Roots the target. Also blurs vision and reduces movement speed after root expires. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Coercer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Recklessness </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Increases attack speed on all group members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Coercer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lysiras Forced Jig </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Coerces the target to perform action. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Coercer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lysiras Forced Mirth </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Coerces the target to perform the action. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Coercer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Power of Suggestion </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the groups power pool, arcane mitigation, and grants a ward that periodically absorbs a small amount of arcane damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Coercer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Mesmerize </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="tex